+
+## JSON Merge Patch
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an [RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386)
+and returns the merged JSON value without changing either input. Object patches recursively merge
+members, with `null` removing a member; arrays and other non-object patches replace the target value.
